# {name}

A gero project. The entry point is `src/main.gr` — a Gero source
file, built to a `.gx` cartridge by `gero build`.

## Build

```bash
gero build                    # → out/debug/{name}.gx
gero build --release          # → out/release/{name}.gx
gero run out/debug/{name}.gx
```

## Test

Tests live under `tests/` as `@test` defs. `gero test` collects
them, runs each on a fresh VM, and reports the ones whose `assert`
does not hold.

```bash
gero test                     # every @test under tests/
gero test double              # only tests whose name matches
```

## Check + format

```bash
gero check                    # type-check without building
gero fmt                      # rewrite to canonical form
gero fmt --check              # fail if anything would change (CI)
```

## Editor setup

Syntax highlighting, diagnostics and navigation are covered in the
